  "status": "prose",
  "value": "Pre-trained on the Dolma 3 dataset, then post-trained on Dolci datasets in three stages: Stage 1 SFT (supervised fine-tuning), Stage 2 DPO (direct preference optimization), Stage 3 RLVR (reinforcement learning from verifiable rewards).",
  "quote": "These models are pre-trained on the Dolma 3 dataset and post-trained on the Dolci datasets. [...] #### Stage 1: SFT [...] - supervised fine-tuning on the Dolci-Think-SFT-7B dataset. This dataset consits of math, code, chat, and general knowledge queries. [...] #### Stage 2:DPO [...] - direct preference optimization on the Dolci-Think-DPO-7B dataset. This dataset consits of math, code, chat, and general knowledge queries. [...] #### Stage 3: RLVR [...] - reinforcement learning from verifiable rewards on the Dolci-Think-RL-7B dataset. This dataset consits of math, code, instruction-following, and general chat queries.",
  "quotes": [
   "These models are pre-trained on the Dolma 3 dataset and post-trained on the Dolci datasets.",
